      <div type="clause" n="2.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 2.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 ælc preost finde him XII festermen, þæt he preostlage wille healdan mid rihte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And each priest is to provide himself with 12 sureties, that he will rightly observe the priest's law.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And every priest is to find for himself twelve bondmen, that he will properly abide by the priests' law.</ab>
      </div>
